     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRAttesterLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRAttesterLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRAttesterLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMAttester.html\">Logical model - FR LM Attester</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-authenticator.html\">CDA - authenticator</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMAttester.html#s-FRLMAttester\">FRLMAttester</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-authenticator.html#s-Authenticator\">Authenticator</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMAttester.html#s-FRLMAttester.dateTime\">FRLMAttester.dateTime</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-authenticator.html#s-Authenticator.time\">Authenticator.time</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttester.attester[x]:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-authenticator.html#s-Authenticator.assignedEntity\">Authenticator.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le validateur professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMAttester.attester[x]:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-authenticator.html#s-Authenticator.assignedEntity\">Authenticator.assignedEntity</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le validateur système est de type FRLMDevice (composant commun), cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMAttester.html\">Logical model - FR LM Attester</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html\">FR Composition Document</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMAttester.html#s-FRLMAttester\">FRLMAttester</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-composition-document.html#s-Composition.attester\">Composition.attester</a></td><td>1..*</td><td>todo</td><td>attester.where(mode='professional')</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMAttester.html#s-FRLMAttester.dateTime\">FRLMAttester.dateTime</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fh